# ShitRat Dream Workflow Spike

Named prototype for migrating `/Users/joel/Code/joelhooks/pi-cloudflare-dream` into the Cloudflare sandbox workflows project.

## PARA classification

- Recommended bucket: Project
- Confidence: high
- Why: the next use is execution: prove dreams as dynamic workflows inside the workflow rig, with a clear prototype finish/review point.
- Missing fields: runnable command is not migrated yet; this checkpoint moves Brain/docs only.
- Smallest useful change: keep `pi-cloudflare-dream` as source evidence, but make this named prototype the owning surface.
- Source pointers:
