- Hydration: 9 hydrated JoelClaw session receipts and 75 total locator receipts.
- Coverage: Typesense machines `blaine`, `dark-wizard`, `flagg`, `panda`; hydrated receipts from local JoelClaw transcript paths; runtimes `pi`, `claude`, `codex`.
